From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(v2): add built-in lotusd decentralized share-pool
 coordinator and P2P sharerelay

Add the built-in lotusd decentralized PPLNS share-pool coordinator (mining_pool),
P2P sharerelay gossip, and pool status/share submission RPCs.

Original-Commit: 591867c5b32dbe200774ea8c29ea279480986b06
Original-Patch: v2/031
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Application-Repair: Retain complete original native share-pool coordinator and RPC implementation; compose its node-owned manager initialization with the existing snapshot publisher and kernel-notifications ownership, avoiding duplicate fields and includes.

